rem Test recording control commands
rem Validates RECORDSTART and RECORDSTOP

rem Test 1: Start recording
RECORDSTART
wait 200ms

rem Test 2: Stop recording
RECORDSTOP
wait 100ms

rem Test 3: Start and stop multiple times
RECORDSTART
wait 100ms
RECORDSTOP
wait 100ms

RECORDSTART
wait 100ms
RECORDSTOP
wait 100ms

rem Test 4: Recording with effects
RECORDSTART
effect "Sharp Pixels"
wait 100ms
effect "Soft CRT"
wait 100ms
RECORDSTOP

stop
